><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></strong></p><p><strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></strong></p><p><strong>3.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></strong></p><p><strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></strong></p><p><strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></strong></p><p><strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math></strong></p><p><strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></strong></p><p><strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></strong></p><p>Hence, no real roots.</p><p><strong>4.</strong>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, no solution if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>"
